            "review_title": "Review at Boat Noodle Bangkok - Phan Huy Ich",
            "review_text": "Stay32861102780\n2 contributions\n0\nBoat food\nOct 2025 • Friends\nI had a great experience at Boat Noodle! The restaurant has a cozy and lively atmosphere, perfect for hanging out with friends. The noodle portions are small but flavorful, which makes it fun to try different types of soup and toppings. The broth is rich and authentic, and the Thai-style drinks are refreshing. The staff were friendly and quick to serve. Overall, it’s a great spot if you love Thai street food and want to enjoy something a bit different. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2025",
