            "review_text": "Paradise47577995258\n3 contributions\n0\nThe best noodle\nOct 2025 • Friends\nI had a meal at Boat Noodle Bangkok – Thiso Mall, Phan Huy Ich. I tried the Boat Noodle Herbal Rare Beef (with tendon, no soup) – light broth, tasty egg noodles, and great flavor. Other highlights include spicy Laeng Saeb, desserts like Mango Sticky Rice & Durian Sticky Rice, and the sweet, fragrant Thai Pink Milk Tea. Friendly staff, bright space, mid-range\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 2, 2025",
