            "review_title": "Review at Boat Noodle Bangkok - Phan Huy Ich",
            "review_text": "Khuyên B\n2 contributions\n0\nBoat Noodle\nOct 2025 • Family\nI had an amazing experience at Boat Noodle! The food was incredibly flavorful and authentic – every bite brought me straight to the streets of Thailand. The portion sizes are perfect for sharing and trying a variety of dishes. I especially loved the beef boat noodles – absolutely delicious! The staff were friendly, attentive, and made me feel welcome from the moment I walked in. The atmosphere is cozy and the service is fast. Definitely one of my favorite spots now. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 2, 2025",
